<title>USA: Telebras says no new rate structure set.</title>
<headline>Telebras says no new rate structure set.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian state telecommunications company Telebras said on Thursday no new rate structure had been decided.</p>
<p>In a one-sentence statement released in New York and datelined Brasilia, the company said it was responding to statements in the Brazilian press.</p>
<p>The statement said, &quot;No determination on changes in the tariff structure had been decided and ... the company had not commented on the matter.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212 859-1730</p>
